 stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20v-1a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v1 M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8 M22 20v-1a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9 M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"></path></svg><span>Customers &amp; vehicles</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/catalogue"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12l-8 8-9-9V3h8z M7.5 7.5h.01"></path></svg><span>Price list</span></a></li></ul></nav><div class="shell-main"><header class="shell-topbar"><form class="topbar-search" role="search" action="/en/search" method="get"><label for="shell-search" class="visually-hidden">Search customers and vehicles</label><input id="shell-search" type="search" placeholder="Plate, mobile, name or VIN" dir="auto" name="q"/><button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">Search</button></form><div class="topbar-user"><span class="who"><span>Sara Test</span><small>Service advisor</small></span><a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/ar/vehicles/abc" hrefLang="ar" lang="ar">العربية</a><form action="/api/auth/logout" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="locale" value="en"/><button type="submit" class="btn btn-quiet">Sign out</button></form></div></header><main class="shell-content"><p>page</p></main></div></div></body></html>"`;
